WEBVTT

00:13:25.079 --> 00:13:30.954
be finding their way and finding their
strength and finding their courage

00:13:30.954 --> 00:13:33.537
and and also finding their path, you know,

00:13:33.537 --> 00:13:38.204
and all of those things are made more
difficult when we have difficult parents

00:13:38.204 --> 00:13:40.079
or dead parents or abusive parents.

00:13:40.496 --> 00:13:43.829
But they're all it's part of what
we have to do as humans.

00:13:43.829 --> 00:13:44.954
And and that's why, you know,

00:13:44.954 --> 00:13:49.246
I think so often it wasn't until after
I actually wrote Wild that

00:13:49.246 --> 00:13:53.746
I understood what I had done
on that hike is that

00:13:53.746 --> 00:13:56.496
I had given myself my own rite of passage.

00:13:56.496 --> 00:14:01.829
And, you know, I said, like, you have to
go test yourself to see who you are.